WEBVTT

00:00:14.417 --> 00:00:16.625
- Hmm!
- Hmm!

00:00:20.542 --> 00:00:22.208
We've never been to Peru.

00:00:22.375 --> 00:00:23.958
What? But you must have done.

00:00:24.042 --> 00:00:27.958
I can see you're very busy.
Perhaps we could just go and check.

00:00:28.042 --> 00:00:32.333
There are over two million letters,
diaries and artefacts up in our archive,

00:00:32.417 --> 00:00:34.875
meticulously filed,
and they don't stay that way

00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:38.375
by letting strange men
and their bears rummage around.

00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:40.917
- Listen...
- I'm going to have to ask you to leave.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:43.917
Come on then, Paddington.

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:47.250
Paddington?

00:00:48.583 --> 00:00:49.625
Paddington?

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:53.500
- Paddington!
- Psst! Mr Brown? In here.

00:00:53.583 --> 00:00:56.250
- What are you doing?
- We need to get into that archive.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:00.083
Paddington,
please don't take this the wrong way,

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:02.917
but are you certain
there was an explorer?

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:06.458
You didn't just find a hat
and make up some...

00:01:07.542 --> 00:01:11.333
What? Why are you looking at me
like that?

00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:15.667
Is it me or is it hot in here?
Why do I feel so...

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.417
- Uncomfortable?
- Hmm.

00:01:17.542 --> 00:01:18.750
- Flushed?
- Hmm.

00:01:18.833 --> 00:01:20.292
- Queasy?
- Hmm.

00:01:20.583 --> 00:01:22.250
It's called a hard stare.

00:01:22.333 --> 00:01:25.500
My aunt taught me to do them
when people had forgotten their manners.

00:01:25.625 --> 00:01:28.750
- Oh, give me strength.
- Mr Brown, you can trust me.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.167
There really was an explorer.

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:33.958
And if we can find him,
I know he'll give me a home.

00:01:34.042 --> 00:01:36.625
A proper home, like yours.

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:40.708
Now I've got an idea.
But I'm going to need your help.

00:01:50.625 --> 00:01:53.625
- This is never going to work.
- Of course it will.

00:01:53.708 --> 00:01:56.292
- You look very pretty.
- That's what they'll say in jail.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.542
- Morning.
- Oh, hello there.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.042
Hold up.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.667
Haven't seen you before, have I?

00:02:05.583 --> 00:02:08.917
No, that's right. I'm new.

00:02:10.417 --> 00:02:12.625
Hmm... Thought so.

00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:14.958
Lovely day, innit?

00:02:15.792 --> 00:02:18.250
- Unusually hot.
- Yeah.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.208
Just like you.

00:02:24.292 --> 00:02:27.042
Go on, then. Off you pop.

00:02:39.208 --> 00:02:40.375
Right!

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.292
Darkest Peru.

00:02:44.083 --> 00:02:47.708
- 200 items!
- I knew that lady was hiding something.

00:02:56.958 --> 00:02:58.000
What is it?

00:02:58.125 --> 00:03:01.708
It says "record destroyed".
Let's check the others.

00:03:01.792 --> 00:03:02.917
Oi!

00:03:03.125 --> 00:03:04.667
New girl.

00:03:07.792 --> 00:03:09.292
Is there a problem?

00:03:09.375 --> 00:03:14.917
- Forgot to check your pass.
- My p... Oh, my pass. Yes.

00:03:17.625 --> 00:03:19.375
Ah. Oh.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.375
- It's an old photograph.
- Ha.

00:03:23.458 --> 00:03:25.917
I'm sure you've always been a... Whoa.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.000
0-0-2. Retrieve.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.125
You've changed a bit.

00:03:42.667 --> 00:03:44.250
I lost a lot of weight.

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:47.375
You're telling me.

00:03:48.125 --> 00:03:49.958
And the...

00:03:52.833 --> 00:03:53.917
I had it lasered.

00:03:59.292 --> 00:04:01.750
And the arm's grown back.

00:04:04.667 --> 00:04:05.875
It's a false arm.

00:04:13.667 --> 00:04:15.917
You really can't feel a thing?

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:17.833
Huh.

00:04:21.083 --> 00:04:23.792
- Nothing.
- Amazing.

00:04:24.042 --> 00:04:26.542
Well, I'm just off to the toilet.

00:04:27.708 --> 00:04:29.167
See you in a bit.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.000
Mr Brown, I've found something.

00:04:36.083 --> 00:04:39.167
That's brilliant. Now let's put
these back and get out of here.

00:04:48.583 --> 00:04:52.292
- Er... Mr Brown...
- Ah.

00:04:57.292 --> 00:04:59.375
Something's jamming the system.

00:04:59.417 --> 00:05:02.333
I think it's a baguette.
Is that peanut butter?

00:05:02.375 --> 00:05:04.750
Too orange. I think it's...

00:05:04.833 --> 00:05:06.667
Marmalade.

00:05:10.458 --> 00:05:11.708
Hey, you!

00:05:14.083 --> 00:05:16.250
Stop that sexy woman!

00:05:16.917 --> 00:05:18.250
Alt!

